# The Gestures screen: the card dragged and pinched, the bar swiped, held
# and double-tapped, each said on the screen.
tap Gestures
see Drag the card, pinch it, let go
drag Drag me by 60,40
see Dragged 60, 40 at *
pinch Drag me 1.5
see Pinched ×1.50
swipe left on Swipe, hold or double-tap the bar
see Swiped *left
longpress Swiped *
see Held
doubletap Held
see Double-tapped
back
see Native view
